OL,3,GNEWSAMan with rare condition reaches
OL,4,AEverest Base Camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was told he would not live
OL,7,Fbeyond his fourth birthday has
OL,8,Fcompleted a climb to Mount Everest base
OL,9,Fcamp for a charity which supported him
OL,10,Fas a child.
OL,12,FArchie Thompson, 24, from Chesterfield,
OL,13,Fwas diagnosed as a baby with MOMO
OL,14,Fsyndrome, an extremely rare genetic
OL,15,Fcondition with fewer than 10 known
OL,16,Fcases worldwide. The disorder causes
OL,17,Frapid growth, including the eyes and
OL,18,Fhead.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
