OL,3,GNEWSAMan with rare condition reaches
OL,4,AEverest Base Camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite a series of early health
OL,7,Fproblems - including two heart attacks
OL,8,Fbefore the age of two - he has now
OL,9,Fcompleted the mammoth challenge in
OL,10,Forder to give back to children's
OL,11,Fcharity, Demelza.
OL,13,FDefying the odds, Archie said: "It was
OL,14,Feverything I hoped it would be."
